          {
            "id": 2783695,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "In public discussion of business, we take certain values for granted. Today, I'm going to talk about four of them, collaboration, hard work, creativity, and excellence. Most people would say they're all good things. I'm going to suggest that's an oversimple view. The trouble with these values is that they're theoretical concepts removed from the reality of day to day business.",
