          },
          {
            "id": 2784003,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "My point is that the task wasn't really suited to team working. So why make it one? Teamwork can also lead to inconsistency, a common cause of poor sales. In the case of a smartphone that a certain company launched, one director wanted to target the business market, and another demanded it was aimed at consumers. The company wanted both directors to be involved, so gave the product a consumer friendly name but marketed it to companies.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2784004,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My point is that the task wasn't really suited to team working.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 200.46,
                  "from": 195.98,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2784017,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So why make it one?",
