                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2784036,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In the case of a smartphone that a certain company launched, one director wanted to target the business market, and another demanded it was aimed at consumers.",
                "meta": {
