            "value": "Insisting on excellence in everything we do is time consuming, wastes energy, and leads to losing out on opportunities. Sometimes second rate work is more worthwhile than excellence. Make sure it's excellent sounds like a good approach to business, but the just get started approach is likely to be more successful.",
